  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third phase of the Participatory Slum Upgrading Programme &#xbf; PSUP 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed third phase of the Participatory Slum Upgrading Programme (2 previous phases were financed under the 9 and 10th EDF) will build on the achievements and momentum of the previous phases and aims to address some of the root causes of the marginalisation of slums dwellers through strategic, multi-sectoral, multi-stakeholder partnerships and focused planning and implementation actions.The programme will seek to achieve the following specific objectives:Specific Objective 1 (SO1): Strengthen global partnerships and policy dialogue for participatory slum upgrading and prevention (in all ACP countries).Specific Objective 2 (SO2): Improve knowledge and capacities for participatory slum upgrading and prevention (for more than 50% of the ACP countries) and slum dwellers living conditions:</narrative>
  </description>
